    },
    {
      "id": "seg:code:styling-toggles-in-a-hierarchy:0016:0001",
      "blockId": "code:styling-toggles-in-a-hierarchy:0016",
      "type": "preserve",
      "source": "```None\nHStack {\n    Toggle(isOn: $isFlagged) {\n        Label(\"Flag\", systemImage: \"flag.fill\")\n    }\n    Toggle(isOn: $isMuted) {\n        Label(\"Mute\", systemImage: \"speaker.slash.fill\")\n    }\n}\n.toggleStyle(.button)\n```",
      "normalizedSource": "```None HStack { Toggle(isOn: $isFlagged) { Label(\"Flag\", systemImage: \"flag.fill\") } Toggle(isOn: $isMuted) { Label(\"Mute\", systemImage: \"speaker.slash.fill\") } } .toggleStyle(.button) ```",
      "sourceHash": "f0597005c57d6f90bf70008c1a65748799a1d1053f19202781ea417f1782244a",
      "translatable": false,
      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "For example, you can apply the `ToggleStyle/button` style to an `HStack`:",
      "contextAfter": "The example above has the following appearance when `isFlagged` is `true` and `isMuted` is `false`:",
      "documentTitle": "toggleStyle(:)",
      "framework": "PermissionKit",
      "ko": "```None\nHStack {\n    Toggle(isOn: $isFlagged) {\n        Label(\"Flag\", systemImage: \"flag.fill\")\n    }\n    Toggle(isOn: $isMuted) {\n        Label(\"Mute\", systemImage: \"speaker.slash.fill\")\n    }\n}\n.toggleStyle(.button)\n```",
      "status": "preserved",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": true
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:styling-toggles-in-a-hierarchy:0017:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:styling-toggles-in-a-hierarchy:0017",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "The example above has the following appearance when `isFlagged` is `true` and `isMuted` is `false`:",
      "normalizedSource": "The example above has the following appearance when `isFlagged` is `true` and `isMuted` is `false`:",
